nd Shop exclusive GRAMMYs and Camilo Merchandise\r\n📸 Walk the Red Carpet and take photos with your friends\r\n✈️ Fly your own plane around Las Vegas and collect items\r\n📋 Answer GRAMMYs quiz questions for a chance to win an item\r\n\r\nAnd that’s not all. Come back and visit each day for a chance to meet Camilo, Glass Animals, Sofia Carson, and Walker Hayes. Schedule available here:\r\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/14466327/The-Grammy-Awards-Official-Roblox-Group/","path":"/game/8893378293-grammy-week","slug":"8893378293-grammy-week","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f55bf3a0e928996d92eb5f24e98017d71a3ffde73b70becc981f41a21bbc3c10.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-619b077bee0a088b02f2abbe6ac4f616/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2383069,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-04-03T16:31:01.904Z","creator":{"name":"Dubit","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":9648883891,"name":"[BETA] Festival Tycoon ","desc":"Build your own music festival with The Chainsmokers’ Festival Tycoon. Along the way, you will explore the Islands, build a roller coaster, complete a daring quest and boogie it down while creating the most fantastic music festival ever!\r\n\r\n🎩 Earn incredible FREE avatar items \r\n\r\n🏆 Don't forget to like and favorite the game\r\n\r\n💃 Dance to your favorite Chainsmokers songs\r\n\r\n🛍️ Shop The Chainsmokers & other avatar accessories to show off your best festival apparel!\r\n\r\n🎮 Available for PC, XBOX, Tablet and Mobile\r\n\r\n💾 Don’t worry, all progress is autosaved so you can pick the party back up at any time!\r\n","path":"/game/9648883891-festival-tycoon","slug":"9648883891-festival-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/696d8d053ed2044cf80807e47f5531cccf9da446c4d537b017c90b363629df72.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cbdf6f664f4e899af29333d440405a36/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":37103280,"verified":false,"updatedA